{
  "_comment": [
    "Authority document for FTB Quests chapter icons.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. FTB Quests 2101.1.30 reads a chapter icon in",
    "QuestObjectBase.readData via nbt.getCompound(\"icon\"). A *string* value",
    "(icon: \"create:andesite_alloy\") is not a compound, so getCompound returns an",
    "EMPTY CompoundTag, rawIcon becomes ItemStack.EMPTY, and writeData then skips",
    "the field entirely -- the icon is deleted from the .snbt the next time the",
    "quest file is saved. Chapter.getAltIcon() then returns",
    "IconAnimation.fromList(every quest icon in the chapter), which is the",
    "'cycling through every icon in the chapter' behaviour.",
    "",
    "So chapter icons MUST be written as a compound: icon: { id: \"<item id>\" }.",
    "That form round-trips through FTB Quests' load/save cycle and survives",
    "playing the pack. Never write the bare-string form again.",
    "",
    "'candidates' is an ordered fallback list; the generator picks the first id",
    "that resolves against the pack's item index and records it in 'resolved'.",
    "Run dev/scripts/generators/apply_ftbquests_chapter_icons.py to apply,",
    "and dev/scripts/audit_ftbquests_chapter_icons.py to verify."
  ],
